1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Princess Knight,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Thirty-Sixth Episode
The Spell of Satan

15
00:02:08,741 --> 00:02:10,891
Is the roast lizard ready?

16
00:02:10,941 --> 00:02:13,660
Bring the bat eye soup immediately!

17
00:02:14,261 --> 00:02:16,900
What's wrong, Zelda?
Aren't you eating anymore?

18
00:02:17,021 --> 00:02:19,376
- No, I'm full now.
- Eat!

19
00:02:19,701 --> 00:02:23,296
You'll never become a
great witch if you eat so little!

20
00:02:23,341 --> 00:02:25,616
- Hurry up!
- Yes, sir!

21
00:02:25,661 --> 00:02:29,290
Here we are with the dishes,
with the delicacies we've cooked!

22
00:02:29,341 --> 00:02:32,174
Such treats!

23
00:02:32,501 --> 00:02:34,457
I had today's menu prepared...

24
00:02:34,501 --> 00:02:36,696
..taking into account the
diet you have to follow.

25
00:02:36,981 --> 00:02:40,610
- Here you go!
- Here you go! - Here you go!

26
00:02:41,181 --> 00:02:43,695
Eat, Zelda! The lizard
will make you tenacious..

27
00:02:43,741 --> 00:02:46,619
and the bat eye soup
will make you cunning!

28
00:02:46,661 --> 00:02:48,538
Come on, eat, Zelda!

29
00:02:54,301 --> 00:02:58,977
The fire has gone out!
What happened? What is it?

30
00:03:03,621 --> 00:03:05,452
What's going on?

31
00:03:05,581 --> 00:03:07,856
It's Mother!
Mother is back!

32
00:03:07,901 --> 00:03:09,778
Your mother is back, you say?!

33
00:03:09,821 --> 00:03:12,210
Damn,
the peace and quiet is over!

34
00:03:18,541 --> 00:03:21,055
It's nice to return
after a long absence.

35
00:03:21,101 --> 00:03:23,569
I hope Zelda has become
a great witch.

36
00:03:23,901 --> 00:03:25,812
Let's go home!

37
00:03:40,021 --> 00:03:42,296
I'm here, my dears!

38
00:03:42,341 --> 00:03:44,377
Welcome back!

39
00:03:45,621 --> 00:03:48,658
- Dearest!
- Zelda, how are you?

40
00:03:48,701 --> 00:03:50,737
I was so worried
thinking about you,

41
00:03:50,781 --> 00:03:52,897
that I couldn't
think of anything else!

42
00:03:52,941 --> 00:03:55,011
Not even during the conference!

43
00:03:57,061 --> 00:03:59,814
That damned witches'
conference never ended!

44
00:03:59,861 --> 00:04:02,011
It lasted
a whole long year!

45
00:04:02,061 --> 00:04:04,416
Have you made progress
in your witchcraft lessons?

46
00:04:04,461 --> 00:04:07,259
Have you agreed to receive the heart
of Princess Sapphire,

47
00:04:07,301 --> 00:04:09,531
which your father
told me about in the letter?

48
00:04:09,581 --> 00:04:11,299
Her girl's heart!

49
00:04:11,341 --> 00:04:14,139
You will be a perfect witch
with the heart of a Princess!

50
00:04:14,181 --> 00:04:16,775
Now show me
what you have learned!

51
00:04:16,981 --> 00:04:19,859
- Come on! Go ahead!
- Dear... Dear...

52
00:04:20,341 --> 00:04:23,014
Well, you know... I don't know if...

53
00:04:23,061 --> 00:04:26,337
What the hell are you muttering?
Speak more clearly!

54
00:04:26,381 --> 00:04:29,612
Zelda hasn't yet...
hasn't learned yet!

55
00:04:29,661 --> 00:04:32,221
What? Not yet?! It's not possible!

56
00:04:32,261 --> 00:04:35,697
Zelda, say: have you not yet
become a witch? Is it true?!

57
00:04:35,741 --> 00:04:38,778
And I who had placed
so many hopes in you!

58
00:04:38,821 --> 00:04:41,096
- Forgive me, mother...
- Forgive you?!

59
00:04:41,141 --> 00:04:43,894
Darling, I still haven't
managed to get Sapphire's heart!

60
00:04:43,941 --> 00:04:46,580
I'd take a hammer to that
eggplant head of yours...

61
00:04:46,621 --> 00:04:48,532
until it becomes a real pumpkin!

62
00:04:49,141 --> 00:04:53,020
I'd like to know what the
hell you've been doing all year!

63
00:04:53,181 --> 00:04:55,058
I spread the word
to the four winds...

64
00:04:55,101 --> 00:04:57,410
...saying that I have a daughter
who is a real witch and you...

65
00:04:57,461 --> 00:05:00,259
How does this make
me look now?! Damn it!

66
00:05:01,101 --> 00:05:03,012
Fine then!

67
00:05:03,221 --> 00:05:05,291
I'll take care of it myself!

68
00:05:05,341 --> 00:05:08,777
But I'll do it my way, not like that
incompetent father of yours did.

69
00:05:08,821 --> 00:05:11,415
Very soon I will make of you
a true witch!

70
00:05:11,741 --> 00:05:14,574
That girl named Sapphire,
or whatever else she is called,

71
00:05:14,621 --> 00:05:16,816
- does she still live in the castle?
- Yes, of course!

72
00:05:16,861 --> 00:05:20,012
- Let me help you, dear!
- No! You stay and take care of the house!

73
00:05:26,541 --> 00:05:28,532
What a beautiful day!

74
00:05:31,381 --> 00:05:33,656
A "forget-me-not"!

75
00:05:33,941 --> 00:05:36,694
I wonder what the language
of "forget-me-nots" is..!

76
00:05:38,141 --> 00:05:40,860
Let's see..
Is it a secret?

77
00:05:42,021 --> 00:05:44,012
It's true, it's a secret!

78
00:06:02,941 --> 00:06:05,660
That day,
Prince Franco told me:

79
00:06:05,781 --> 00:06:09,410
"I like you, beautiful girl,
and I like how you dance very much!"

80
00:06:10,701 --> 00:06:12,817
Secret! Secret!

81
00:06:15,060 --> 00:06:18,258
Teddy bear, do you know the language
of "forget-me-nots"?

82
00:06:18,700 --> 00:06:21,215
I have a pleasant secret
unknown to everyone,

83
00:06:21,260 --> 00:06:23,820
but I think that to you
I will end up telling it.

84
00:06:23,860 --> 00:06:25,613
Princess!

85
00:06:27,020 --> 00:06:30,536
Who are you to penetrate into the
most secret part of the castle?

86
00:06:31,300 --> 00:06:33,610
Smell that fragrance!

87
00:06:42,180 --> 00:06:45,218
Anyone who smells the scent
of my flowers becomes a doll,

88
00:06:45,260 --> 00:06:48,810
a charming doll
and obedient to its master!

89
00:06:49,180 --> 00:06:52,093
Stand up, doll!
Go to Satan's cave! Go!

90
00:06:52,180 --> 00:06:55,139
Go to Satan's cave!
And go there alone!

91
00:06:57,820 --> 00:07:00,130
It would be easy for me to take you there

92
00:07:00,180 --> 00:07:03,332
but I, Lady Hellion,
admired by all the witches,

93
00:07:03,380 --> 00:07:06,578
won't do it.
Go on your own!

94
00:07:11,900 --> 00:07:14,210
This is my way
of doing things.

95
00:07:17,820 --> 00:07:20,619
Listen, Zelda,
for your father's sake...

96
00:07:20,740 --> 00:07:23,892
Don't keep repeating
that you don't want to become a witch,

97
00:07:23,940 --> 00:07:26,171
otherwise your mother
will fly into a rage!

98
00:07:26,220 --> 00:07:29,577
Won’t you tell me why you don't
study witchcraft like the other witches?

99
00:07:29,620 --> 00:07:31,293
Come on! Come on! Come on! Come on!

100
00:07:36,660 --> 00:07:39,732
No! No! I don't want to become
a witch!

101
00:07:39,780 --> 00:07:42,534
Soon they will bring
Sapphire here and then I...

102
00:07:42,740 --> 00:07:46,415
No! No! I must find
a way to stop it!

103
00:07:47,140 --> 00:07:48,893
Maybe...

104
00:07:49,140 --> 00:07:51,496
Maybe I have an idea to help her!

105
00:08:58,621 --> 00:09:01,419
Let's go to Satan's mountain,
Opal.

106
00:09:07,141 --> 00:09:09,018
Oh, Sapphire!

107
00:09:11,501 --> 00:09:14,538
Satan's mountain,
Satan's mountain...

108
00:09:14,581 --> 00:09:16,492
Sapphire, don't go!

109
00:09:16,541 --> 00:09:18,497
But I must go.

110
00:09:18,541 --> 00:09:20,691
What’s the matter, Sapphire?

111
00:09:21,581 --> 00:09:25,494
Mom made you smell the drug
that turns people into dolls!

112
00:09:25,541 --> 00:09:27,691
Poor Sapphire...!

113
00:09:29,421 --> 00:09:31,889
I wonder if Mom
put the drug here!

114
00:09:33,181 --> 00:09:35,172
Is it an important flower?

115
00:09:35,821 --> 00:09:38,540
- Franco...
- Franco?

116
00:09:39,701 --> 00:09:42,534
He is the Prince of Goldland.
His name is Franco.

117
00:09:42,581 --> 00:09:45,414
My Franco
is the most beautiful Prince there is.

118
00:09:46,421 --> 00:09:48,776
It seems to me that you like him a lot, right?

119
00:09:48,821 --> 00:09:51,335
Then I'll take you to his palace!

120
00:09:52,621 --> 00:09:54,930
Follow me, horse!
Let's go to Goldland!

121
00:09:54,981 --> 00:09:57,814
I am certain that Prince Franco
will help her!

122
00:10:02,501 --> 00:10:05,140
Sapphire is not here!
And neither is Zelda!

123
00:10:05,781 --> 00:10:08,375
May I know
what the hell you have done?

124
00:10:08,421 --> 00:10:10,537
Don't be angry, dear!

125
00:10:10,581 --> 00:10:14,130
We can easily find out
where Sapphire is with the magic ball.

126
00:10:16,261 --> 00:10:18,456
Magic ball, tell me!

127
00:10:19,021 --> 00:10:22,331
Oh, Sapphire! But she is not headed here!

128
00:10:23,341 --> 00:10:26,458
Oh, heavens! Perhaps my spell
has broken!

129
00:10:26,501 --> 00:10:29,334
No, it's impossible!
Get ready to go out, quickly!

130
00:10:29,381 --> 00:10:31,611
Go out?! But where do you want to go?

131
00:10:31,661 --> 00:10:35,290
To Goldland, blockhead!
What good is that ball to you,

132
00:10:35,341 --> 00:10:37,901
if you don't even know how to see
where everyone is headed?!

133
00:11:00,421 --> 00:11:03,731
Hey, look at that strange cat!
It looks like he has it in for us!

134
00:11:15,101 --> 00:11:17,171
He's dancing really well..

135
00:11:23,061 --> 00:11:25,336
I think he escaped from a circus

136
00:11:25,421 --> 00:11:27,298
Sleep!

137
00:11:31,901 --> 00:11:33,937
Sleep!

138
00:11:50,341 --> 00:11:53,697
Here we are, Sapphire!
This is the Prince's chamber.

139
00:11:55,581 --> 00:11:58,220
Wait a moment!
He will see us soon.

140
00:12:01,581 --> 00:12:03,412
Please, come in!

141
00:12:04,461 --> 00:12:06,213
Who is it? What do you want?

142
00:12:07,661 --> 00:12:09,652
Princess Sapphire!

143
00:12:10,701 --> 00:12:13,056
I am happy to see you, Sapphire!

144
00:12:14,101 --> 00:12:16,934
How kind this Prince is!

145
00:12:16,981 --> 00:12:19,211
How are you? Why aren't you speaking?

146
00:12:19,501 --> 00:12:21,332
What is wrong?

147
00:12:22,581 --> 00:12:25,141
Sapphire, you are acting strange!
Do you feel unwell?

148
00:12:25,541 --> 00:12:28,419
He has a pleasant appearance
that inspires confidence.

149
00:12:30,221 --> 00:12:33,611
Prince Frank, a stranger
has forced his way into the castle!

150
00:12:34,341 --> 00:12:36,013
A stranger?!

151
00:12:36,461 --> 00:12:38,292
Sapphire, perhaps you

152
00:12:39,581 --> 00:12:41,333
I think I understand..

153
00:12:41,421 --> 00:12:43,696
There is no stranger
in here!

154
00:12:44,021 --> 00:12:46,774
Open the door
and let me make sure!

155
00:12:46,821 --> 00:12:49,130
Someone forced their way
into the castle?!

156
00:12:49,181 --> 00:12:51,172
Oh, Your Highness!

157
00:12:51,341 --> 00:12:54,253
I'll inspect the room
myself! Get out of the way!

158
00:12:54,301 --> 00:12:56,019
Yes, sir!

159
00:12:57,141 --> 00:13:01,214
Franco! It's me: your uncle
Chanel! Open the door!

160
00:13:01,421 --> 00:13:04,333
Yes, uncle, just a moment!
Come here, I have an idea!

161
00:13:20,661 --> 00:13:22,731
Please, come in, Uncle Chanel.

162
00:13:23,301 --> 00:13:26,213
If you find anyone, you
can arrest them if you like.

163
00:13:32,141 --> 00:13:34,211
Franco, who is this lady?

164
00:13:34,461 --> 00:13:37,021
Lady? But look at her
closely, Uncle Chanel!

165
00:13:37,061 --> 00:13:39,370
It's a doll that a dear
friend of mine gave me.

166
00:13:39,421 --> 00:13:41,730
I had to put it on the
sofa because it's too big...

167
00:13:41,781 --> 00:13:44,136
...to be able to fit it in a drawer.

168
00:13:44,181 --> 00:13:46,137
She really looks like a girl

169
00:13:51,221 --> 00:13:53,371
A girl with beautiful long hair!

170
00:13:53,461 --> 00:13:55,895
Damn, she looks like the one from the dream!

171
00:14:06,821 --> 00:14:10,177
Franco? Franco! Franco!

172
00:14:10,381 --> 00:14:13,930
You are contemplating that doll
as if you wanted to marry her!

173
00:14:14,421 --> 00:14:17,493
- Marry her?!
- Now listen to me carefully, Franco!

174
00:14:17,541 --> 00:14:19,736
What do you think of this lady?

175
00:14:23,661 --> 00:14:26,414
Maybe she isn't very beautiful, it's true,
but she is very rich.

176
00:14:26,461 --> 00:14:29,612
- I don't want her!
- Please, be reasonable!

177
00:14:29,661 --> 00:14:31,652
At least get engaged to her!

178
00:14:31,701 --> 00:14:34,010
She will bring us a dowry
of a billion Yen.

179
00:14:34,061 --> 00:14:37,497
With that sum, Goldland
will be able to do great things!

180
00:14:37,821 --> 00:14:39,812
I said no!

181
00:14:41,581 --> 00:14:43,856
I don't like marrying
for interest, Uncle!

182
00:14:43,901 --> 00:14:47,018
- I will choose the one who will be
my wife. - You selfish fool!

183
00:14:47,061 --> 00:14:50,656
Do what I tell you, or else
marry this damned doll!

184
00:14:50,901 --> 00:14:53,176
Of course I would! And right now!

185
00:14:53,221 --> 00:14:55,894
Don't make fun of your uncle!

186
00:14:57,221 --> 00:15:00,019
This time I will succeed
in making you marry her!

187
00:15:00,061 --> 00:15:03,531
If you don't say yes to her by Christmas,
I will kick you out of the castle!

188
00:15:07,621 --> 00:15:09,657
I will never obey him, Sapphire

189
00:15:10,901 --> 00:15:13,335
I won't let you escape this time.

190
00:15:13,381 --> 00:15:16,293
I would even be capable of giving my life for you.

191
00:15:25,741 --> 00:15:29,734
Sapphire, what happened to you? It's as if you were truly a doll.

192
00:15:54,621 --> 00:15:56,816
Did you listen to the conversation?

193
00:15:56,861 --> 00:15:58,897
Let's break through the roof and take her away!

194
00:15:58,941 --> 00:16:01,455
Break through the roof?! How foolish you are!

195
00:16:01,501 --> 00:16:04,015
Any poor devil would do that!

196
00:16:04,061 --> 00:16:05,892
What's wrong?

197
00:16:06,181 --> 00:16:09,890
I'm not surprised at all that you haven't been able, in so many years,

198
00:16:09,941 --> 00:16:12,216
to make Zelda a real witch!

199
00:16:12,261 --> 00:16:14,013
But I am not like you!

200
00:16:23,341 --> 00:16:25,650
- How do I look?
- Wonderful, dear!

201
00:16:25,701 --> 00:16:29,057
You are beautiful! But may
I ask what you intend to do?

202
00:16:29,141 --> 00:16:32,497
Wait and you will see how
I will manage to succeed.

203
00:16:35,421 --> 00:16:38,731
I am very happy to meet
you. Who are you, Princess?

204
00:16:39,021 --> 00:16:42,809
I am Princess De Streghis
and I come from Hellion.

205
00:16:43,021 --> 00:16:46,093
And I am her faithful servant:
Stotten!

206
00:16:46,141 --> 00:16:48,371
And what have you come to do
in Goldland?

207
00:16:48,421 --> 00:16:50,412
I, really.

208
00:16:50,621 --> 00:16:52,896
Tell him, Stotten!

209
00:16:53,861 --> 00:16:58,457
The Princess fell in love at
first sight with Prince Franco,

210
00:16:58,501 --> 00:17:00,810
during the last military parade.

211
00:17:01,341 --> 00:17:03,013
Really?

212
00:17:03,061 --> 00:17:06,497
We would be delighted if you would accept
our introductory gift.

213
00:17:08,781 --> 00:17:11,898
Please forgive us
if it is perhaps a bit too small.

214
00:17:12,581 --> 00:17:15,015
Do not be surprised!
We use diamonds...

215
00:17:15,061 --> 00:17:17,336
...instead of gravel,
in our country!

216
00:17:17,381 --> 00:17:20,020
Diamonds instead of gravel?!

217
00:17:20,541 --> 00:17:23,009
Poor fool!
They are just pebbles!

218
00:17:23,061 --> 00:17:25,655
Therefore we will give you
as many as you want!

219
00:17:25,701 --> 00:17:30,695
If Princess De Streghis and
Prince Franco become engaged,

220
00:17:30,741 --> 00:17:33,380
we will also give you a thousand tons
of ancient coins.

221
00:17:33,421 --> 00:17:35,412
A thousand tons?!

222
00:17:38,301 --> 00:17:42,453
A thousand tons...
A thousand tons of ancient coins!

223
00:17:42,501 --> 00:17:46,540
King Chanel, what do you say to this
marriage proposal of ours?

224
00:17:46,581 --> 00:17:49,732
A thousand tons of ancient coins!

225
00:17:50,021 --> 00:17:52,819
Chanel, then, do you agree?

226
00:18:01,181 --> 00:18:03,172
Of course I agree!

227
00:18:03,221 --> 00:18:05,212
It will be the most beautiful
engagement in the world!

228
00:18:05,261 --> 00:18:07,695
Prince Franco will
also agree.

229
00:18:08,501 --> 00:18:11,652
- Stotten!
- Congratulations, Princess!

230
00:18:11,701 --> 00:18:14,818
Let's get down to business! You must offer her
a token of engagement.

231
00:18:15,021 --> 00:18:18,218
Certainly, with pleasure!
I'll order the ring right away!

232
00:18:18,261 --> 00:18:21,333
I would like something
different from a ring.

233
00:18:21,381 --> 00:18:23,212
Anything you wish!

234
00:18:23,261 --> 00:18:27,015
I've heard that Prince
Franco has a beautiful doll.

235
00:18:27,061 --> 00:18:29,655
What? You would like his doll?!

236
00:18:30,581 --> 00:18:33,653
Is it strange, perhaps,
to ask for a doll?

237
00:18:35,101 --> 00:18:37,615
Absolutely! There is
nothing strange about it!

238
00:18:37,661 --> 00:18:41,449
I'll bring it to you right away! Wait for
me here a second! I'm going to get it!

239
00:18:42,901 --> 00:18:45,734
It seems your plan
worked, dear.

240
00:18:46,421 --> 00:18:50,460
Open up! Open up! Franco,
open the door right now!

241
00:18:50,661 --> 00:18:52,811
Franco, give me the doll!

242
00:18:52,861 --> 00:18:54,817
I won't give it to you for any reason!

243
00:18:58,901 --> 00:19:03,656
It isn't very high.
Curtains, twist yourselves!

244
00:19:03,741 --> 00:19:05,891
Form a rope!

245
00:19:12,221 --> 00:19:14,018
Why are you pulling me?

246
00:19:15,421 --> 00:19:17,889
Damn it, break down the door!

247
00:19:26,061 --> 00:19:28,859
Franco! Franco, where are you?

248
00:19:29,621 --> 00:19:31,418
The window!

249
00:19:32,301 --> 00:19:34,940
He's in the courtyard!
Inspect the courtyard!

250
00:19:36,501 --> 00:19:40,016
Hurry, Sapphire! Hurry!
Hurry! We will hide there!

251
00:19:46,341 --> 00:19:49,014
Poor me, this is a chapel!

252
00:19:49,061 --> 00:19:52,770
I can't go in there,
because I am the daughter of Satan.

253
00:19:59,541 --> 00:20:02,135
Sapphire, do not fear!
I will never leave you.

254
00:20:02,181 --> 00:20:04,854
I will fight against anyone
who wants to hurt you,

255
00:20:04,901 --> 00:20:07,335
- even if it were my uncle!
- Did you find him?

256
00:20:07,381 --> 00:20:09,611
- No!
- Look again!

257
00:20:10,421 --> 00:20:12,139
Quick!

258
00:20:12,941 --> 00:20:16,490
Princess De Streghis,
I will have the doll before evening!

259
00:20:16,781 --> 00:20:20,456
She's gone! The jewels..!
What the hell happened?

260
00:20:29,901 --> 00:20:31,653
It didn't go well.

261
00:20:31,821 --> 00:20:36,337
Shut up, you idiot! I left
because I have another plan in mind.

262
00:20:37,501 --> 00:20:41,096
This drug turns
all creatures into stone.

263
00:20:45,741 --> 00:20:47,413
Look!

264
00:20:55,221 --> 00:20:57,416
Ah, it really works!

265
00:20:57,461 --> 00:20:59,895
And all those
who drink this water..

266
00:20:59,941 --> 00:21:02,216
.will be turned into stone!

267
00:21:33,261 --> 00:21:36,014
I don't understand: Princess
De Streghis disappears,

268
00:21:36,061 --> 00:21:38,291
the jewels become stones..

269
00:21:38,541 --> 00:21:40,736
Have you not found Franco yet?

270
00:21:40,781 --> 00:21:44,774
What are you waiting for?!
Go and find him immediately!

271
00:21:47,821 --> 00:21:50,176
Stone! Stone!

272
00:21:51,581 --> 00:21:54,698
My soldiers have
all turned into stone!

273
00:21:54,741 --> 00:21:57,301
This must be the work of Satan!

274
00:21:58,741 --> 00:22:02,370
Satan! Satan!

275
00:22:04,181 --> 00:22:06,137
Is there no one here?

276
00:22:06,181 --> 00:22:08,854
Is there no one left
in this castle?

277
00:22:08,901 --> 00:22:11,620
They've all
turned to stone!

278
00:22:23,781 --> 00:22:26,090
Oh, look! There's King Chanel!

279
00:22:29,661 --> 00:22:33,256
It's Satan! Satan is
definitely in this castle!

280
00:22:37,181 --> 00:22:40,014
Sapphire, something is
wrong. I'm going to check.

281
00:22:40,501 --> 00:22:43,413
Prince Frank, no!
You mustn't go out!

282
00:22:43,901 --> 00:22:45,892
Oh, he's already gone!

283
00:22:47,701 --> 00:22:49,612
It's too quiet.

284
00:22:51,101 --> 00:22:53,012
But that's my uncle!

285
00:22:53,261 --> 00:22:56,059
He isn't moving at all!
Let's go have a look...

286
00:23:00,581 --> 00:23:03,493
But he's turned to stone! This
is certainly the work of Satan!

287
00:23:10,861 --> 00:23:14,012
- Satan!
- Boy, bring Sapphire here!

288
00:23:14,141 --> 00:23:17,292
- I won't do it!
- Bring Sapphire here,

289
00:23:17,341 --> 00:23:19,297
Otherwise I will hurt you.

290
00:23:19,341 --> 00:23:21,809
I will defend her at the cost of my life!
On your guard!

291
00:23:21,861 --> 00:23:24,136
Hail Satan!

292
00:23:24,821 --> 00:23:26,891
To me, wind!

293
00:23:38,061 --> 00:23:40,336
And now bring out Sapphire!

294
00:23:40,381 --> 00:23:42,531
Come and get her, if you are capable!

295
00:23:42,581 --> 00:23:45,812
- Close that door!
- I'll take care of it!

296
00:23:46,861 --> 00:23:50,012
Stone lion,
flood the Chapel!

297
00:23:56,021 --> 00:23:57,818
The water!

298
00:23:58,141 --> 00:24:01,019
- The water!
- Sapphire, you've regained consciousness!

299
00:24:01,181 --> 00:24:03,456
- Yes, Franco.
- Oh, Sapphire...

300
00:24:06,941 --> 00:24:09,455
Franco! Franco!

301
00:24:10,701 --> 00:24:14,011
- Franco!
- Sapphire! Sapphire!

302
00:24:17,341 --> 00:24:20,219
Sapphire! Franco! Where are you?

303
00:24:23,341 --> 00:24:26,617
The water will soon make
them come out of the Chapel.

304
00:24:28,181 --> 00:24:30,490
- Sapphire!
- Franco!

305
00:24:30,541 --> 00:24:32,611
Sapphire, hold on!

306
00:24:33,341 --> 00:24:36,299
- Franco! Franco!
- Sapphire!

307
00:24:38,421 --> 00:24:41,731
- Franco!
- Sapphire!

308
00:24:47,181 --> 00:24:49,331
Sapphire! Sapphire!

309
00:24:50,741 --> 00:24:54,177
Sapphire, I will save you!
I will save you at any cost!

310
00:25:12,380 --> 00:25:16,000
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

311
00:25:16,001 --> 00:25:19,361
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

312
